      "message": "\u003e but now is taking place after the chipset is powered on.  Is this now creating a race condition between the chipset initializing, and anything hooking pre-init?\n\nFunctionally hook_notify(HOOK_CHIPSET_PRE_INIT); still happens in the same spot. The ap is only guaranteed to be on after power_wait_signals. Though perhaps HOOK_CHIPSET_PRE_INIT should be moved before power_on()",
